  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Welcome to PyPy's documentation!",
      "source_hash": 18264216971349425278,
      "context_hash": 63542534314626261,
      "translation": "PyPy 문서에 오신 것을 환영합니다!",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "PyPy": "PyPy"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-08-14T13:45:44.978077Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Welcome to the documentation for PyPy, a fast_, compliant alternative implementation of the Python_ language.",
      "source_hash": 12421099059684174387,
      "context_hash": 16390298918312780264,
      "translation": "PyPy 문서에 오신 것을 환영합니다. PyPy는 fast_\\ 하고 호환성을 갖춘, Python_\\ 언어의 대안적 구현체입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "PyPy": "PyPy"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-08-14T13:46:09.157738Z",
      "issues": [
        "The Korean reads awkwardly with the untranslated \"fast_\" spliced directly into a Korean clause (a side-effect of preserving the RST hyperlink target), and \"compliant\" is rendered as \"호환성을 갖춘\" (compatible) rather than the more accurate \"표준을 준수하는\" (spec-compliant), though the overall meaning is still understandable."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "If you want to find out more about what PyPy is, have a look at our :doc:`introduction` or consult the `PyPy website`_.",
      "source_hash": 3667798594144106163,
      "context_hash": 727750001158055675,
      "translation": "PyPy가 무엇인지 더 알아보고 싶으시다면, 저희 :doc:`introduction`\\ 을 살펴보시거나 `PyPy website`_\\ 를 참고하세요.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "PyPy": "PyPy"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-08-14T13:45:51.883929Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "If you're interested in trying PyPy out, check out the :doc:`installation instructions <install>`.",
      "source_hash": 6035118392054208746,
      "context_hash": 10364929767772530357,
      "translation": "PyPy를 사용해 보는 데 관심이 있으시다면, :doc:`설치 안내 <install>`\\ 를 확인해 보세요.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "PyPy": "PyPy"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-08-14T13:45:58.270525Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "If you want to help develop PyPy, please have a look at :doc:`contributing <contributing>` and at the repo on https://github.com/pypy/pypy and get in touch (:ref:`contact`)!",
      "source_hash": 17086999464446068451,
      "context_hash": 5956572330990687927,
      "translation": "PyPy 개발을 돕고 싶으시다면 :doc:`contributing <contributing>` 문서와 https://github.com/pypy/pypy 의 저장소를 살펴보시고, (:ref:`contact`)를 통해 연락해 주세요!",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "PyPy": "PyPy"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-08-14T13:46:19.456817Z",
      "issues": [
        "The meaning is accurately conveyed and honorific style is consistent, but \"https://github.com/pypy/pypy 의 저장소를\" reads slightly awkwardly in Korean (URL 뒤에 조사 \"의\"를 붙이는 구조), and moving the parenthetical `(:ref:\\`contact\\`)` to modify \"연락해 주세요\" is a reasonable but noticeably free restructuring of the original syntax."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "All of the documentation and source code is available under the MIT license, unless otherwise specified.",
      "source_hash": 17195483176370406450,
      "context_hash": 579620151129952342,
      "translation": "모든 문서와 소스 코드는 별도로 명시되지 않는 한 MIT 라이선스 하에 제공됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-14T13:46:44.674254Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:5/seg:1",
      "source": "Consult :source:`LICENSE`.",
      "source_hash": 8818691730583972167,
      "context_hash": 4630562208466256364,
      "translation": "자세한 내용은 :source:`LICENSE`\\ 를 참고하시기 바랍니다.",
